              "instruction": "paṇḍuga rōjullō railulō rijarvēṣanu dorakaḍaṁ kaṣṭaṁ. — In the festival season it is hard to get a reservation on the train.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *paṇḍuga rōjullō railulō rijarvēṣanu dorakaḍaṁ kaṣṭaṁ.* — In the festival season it is hard to get a reservation on the train.]"
            },
