            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "మా బోగీ రైలు చివర ఉంది. mā bōgī railu civara undi. Our coach is at the end of the train."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: బోగీలు, bōgīlu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The coaches of a train are its బోగీలు; the number of yours is on the ticket."
            }
          ]
        },
