            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆటో కిరాయి ఎంత? āṭō kirāyi enta? How much is the auto fare?"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It is the charge for hiring a vehicle, and also the rent of a room or a house."
            }
          ]
        },
