          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "కిరాయి (kirāyi) is a loan from Arabic kirāʾ, \"hire, rent\", which reached Telugu through Persian and Hindustani kirāya."
